{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The figure consists of alternating light and dark squares. The number of dark squares exceeds the number of light squares by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff53ae272a484dbbc09d9cd8c495b01ce8bb43c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"347\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c412ffe05ee5b02328949c1081a9349f0768892b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(12); //Force a white background in middle even when transparent fill((3,1)--(12,1)--(12,4)--(3,4)--cycle,white); //Black Squares, Gray Border (blends better than white) for(int a=0; a&lt;7; ++a)  {   filldraw((2a,0)--(2a+1,0)--(2a+1,1)--(2a,1)--cycle,black,gray);  } for(int b=7; b&lt;15; ++b)  {   filldraw((b,14-b)--(b+1,14-b)--(b+1,15-b)--(b,15-b)--cycle,black,gray);  } for(int c=1; c&lt;7; ++c)  {   filldraw((c,c)--(c+1,c)--(c+1,c+1)--(c,c+1)--cycle,black,gray);  } filldraw((6,4)--(7,4)--(7,5)--(6,5)--cycle,black,gray); filldraw((7,5)--(8,5)--(8,6)--(7,6)--cycle,black,gray); filldraw((8,4)--(9,4)--(9,5)--(8,5)--cycle,black,gray); //White Squares, Black Border filldraw((7,4)--(8,4)--(8,5)--(7,5)--cycle,white,black); for(int a=0; a&lt;7; ++a)  {   filldraw((2a+1,0)--(2a+2,0)--(2a+2,1)--(2a+1,1)--cycle,white,black);  } for(int b=9; b&lt;15; ++b)  {   filldraw((b-1,14-b)--(b,14-b)--(b,15-b)--(b-1,15-b)--cycle,white,black);  } for(int c=1; c&lt;7; ++c)  {   filldraw((c+1,c)--(c+2,c)--(c+2,c+1)--(c+1,c+1)--cycle,white,black);  } label(&quot;same&quot;,(6.3,2.45),N); label(&quot;pattern here&quot;,(7.5,1.4),N); [/asy]\" width=\"302\" height=\"162\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that in each row, the number of black squares is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than the number of white squares. Since this figure has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> rows, it has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12eb63493f8776f86ad78db86ac7507195dd9d72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" /> more black squares than white squares.\n</p><p>~sakshamsethi\n(Edited by Zack2008, j314andrews)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that after the first row, each row has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more white square and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more black square than the previous row.  So, this figure has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/2/082e27cba6b088b92ba9dd04bf40fa815c6bf893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + \\cdots + 7 + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" /> black squares and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306fb32d0274c434fc15aedd3dc4dc6a37dc3a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + \\cdots + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" /> white squares. Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20275c18c064aed26474717cc0da174105d1534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 2 + \\cdots + 7 + 8) - (1 + 2 + \\cdots + 7) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"393\" height=\"30\" /> more black squares than white squares.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\"